  "description": "Ride with power and freedom on the Paselec X8 48V Electric Mountain Bike. Designed for both city commuting and rugged trails, this e-bike combines speed, comfort, and endurance for all your adventures.\n\nDurable Aluminum Frame: 27.5” aluminum alloy frame for lightweight strength and agile handling.\n\nFront Shock Absorbing Fork: Aluminum fork with suspension for smooth rides on any terrain.\n\nFat Tires for Stability: 27.5” × 3.0” tires provide traction and control on city streets and off-road paths.\n\nPowerful Motor & Long-Range Battery: 48V rear hub motor with 1300W peak power and 48V 15.6Ah battery reaches speeds up to 28 MPH and assists for over 70 miles.\n\n7-Speed Shimano Gear System: Easy shifting for climbing hills or cruising comfortably.\n\nLCD Display: Monitor speed, battery, and riding data at a glance.\n\nFast Charger Included: 54.6V 2A charger for quick, convenient charging.\n\nPortable & Compact: 31.3KG net weight / 39KG gross weight; easy to store.\n\nWhether commuting, exploring parks, or conquering trails, the Paselec X8 delivers style, speed, and stamina for every ride.",
